<title>USA: Clinton declares major disaster in Colorado.</title>
<headline>Clinton declares major disaster in Colorado.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton on Friday declared  a major disaster in parts of Colorado struck last month by heavy rains,  flash flooding and mudslides, making federal aid available to victims.</p>
<p>The declaration applies to victims in Larimer, Logan and Morgan counties.</p>
</text>
